#: ../../modules/collection.md:1 3d368f9711b54d10aed0f28a602af0b8
msgid "🗂️ Collection"
msgstr "🗂️ 集合（Collection）"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:3 8822877ac202472d802bc0e0eaf17123
msgid "**`#bs.collection:help`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.collection:help`**"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:5 4c346319176f45f8a185e849369837ca
msgid "Functional programming operations for working with collections in Minecraft. This module is NOT a stream module, features are not lazy."
msgstr "用于在 Minecraft 中处理集合的函数式操作。该模块不是流模块，功能不会惰性执行。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:19 c65ac79594f146cc968c91f94d66bd8d
msgid "\"It is better to have 100 functions operate on one data structure than 10 functions on 10 data structures.\""
msgstr "“一种数据结构配上一百个函数，胜过十种数据结构各配十个函数。”"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:20 8f929b80b4c7426c8f38feb2ca5eff20
msgid "Alan Perlis"
msgstr "艾伦·佩利"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:26 b3035b652f4d48e4b16802aad5a0fcc4
msgid "🔧 Functions"
msgstr "🔧 函数"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:28 cc88b4dfddf441e29b33bcf319387c00
msgid "You can find below all functions available in this module."
msgstr "下方列出了该模块提供的全部函数。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:30 39f831bc3f2745b59c27bc62b462e021
msgid "Input and Output"
msgstr "输入与输出"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:33 4ccf25297867462a9c90ef013896a192
msgid "Unlike most Bookshelf modules, collection features typically read their input from `bs:out` instead of `bs:in`. This design facilitates operation chaining, as the output of one function immediately becomes the input for the next."
msgstr "与大多数 Bookshelf 模块不同，集合功能通常从 `bs:out` 而非 `bs:in` 读取输入。这样设计便于链式操作：一个函数的输出会立刻成为下一个函数的输入。"

