msgstr "**存储 `bs:in collection`**：{nbt}`list` 第二个集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1517 4640a74702f74b58b9b4236c1b52fbbb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the difference of the two collections"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 两个集合的差集。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1520 9197871704844f729b04e50362f4dd74
msgid "*Example: difference of [1, 2, 3] and [2, 3, 4]*"
msgstr "*示例：[1, 2, 3] 与 [2, 3, 4] 的差集*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md 9bfffe5c79d64dc0beae5811f8a55042
msgid "Intersect"
msgstr "交集"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1536 4257d632daea429cbecf9a31064c749b
msgid "Compute the intersection of two collections (elements present in both collections, without duplicates)."
msgstr "计算两个集合的交集（同时存在于两个集合中的元素，无重复）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1544 534820438b58429f9be76f10dc9cc848
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the intersection of the two collections"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 两个集合的交集。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1547 8f5dde5539ff4262a16fe2f8a594ea9a
msgid "*Example: intersect [1, 2, 3] and [2, 3, 4]*"
msgstr "*示例：[1, 2, 3] 与 [2, 3, 4] 的交集*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md 24bb3e15eeac4874b30e7a7358df19e9
msgid "Symmetric Difference"
msgstr "对称差集"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1563 88be49de78a24f47a8d94f301689c788
msgid "Compute the symmetric difference of two collections (elements present in either collection, but not in both, without duplicates)."
msgstr "计算两个集合的对称差集（存在于任一个集合但不同时存在于两个中的元素，无重复）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1571 9f38d15103c04d679f27cfe2e3a6ef52
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the symmetric difference of the two collections"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 两个集合的对称差集。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1574 61e2cb7d172347b9b6bec1497e01b4be
msgid "*Example: symmetric difference of [1, 2, 3] and [2, 3, 4]*"
msgstr "*示例：[1, 2, 3] 与 [2, 3, 4] 的对称差集*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md 64047c0c92b24ebc9f327de53c6e7319
msgid "Union"
msgstr "并集"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1590 ce511f9e3bc54100a58abe00e38ab3ee
msgid "Compute the union of two collections (elements present in either collection, without duplicates)."
msgstr "计算两个集合的并集（存在于任一个集合中的元素，无重复）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1598 d7e344050ed941fc95e84c453bc3eaf4
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the union of the two collections"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 两个集合的并集。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1601 f2f618e20e2941a593d0b8f48271d0d6
msgid "*Example: union of [1, 2] and [2, 3]*"
msgstr "*示例：[1, 2] 与 [2, 3] 的并集*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1616 dcfb0edf86a249b38562c7c59d61f757
msgid "Slicing"
msgstr "切片"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1618 48bb49e5ecb849048741e16a97642d9c
msgid "Operations that split a collection into sub-collections or windows."
msgstr "将集合拆分为子集合或窗口的操作。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md 2973144ad541457595d01385e92f6701
msgid "Chunk"
msgstr "分块"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1626 5d0210cc0b624e5cb73f848ac68e0c56
msgid "Split a collection into chunks of size N. If the collection size is not divisible by N, the last chunk will contain the remaining elements."
msgstr "将一个集合拆分为大小为 N 的块。如果集合大小不能被 N 整除，最后一个块将包含剩余的元素。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1629 ea2f4103df7c42a988cc0f9de38efdff
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the collection to split"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 要拆分的集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1634 2b0e513294ab48df8dfbb3d7b6e40daa
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **size**: the size of each chunk"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **size**：每个块的大小。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1638 3d377f18c7d54fc5834c76192b6ff85c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the list of chunks (list of lists)"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 块列表（列表的列表）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1641 b3ede2e059794c388b5d2460a85addc9
msgid "*Example: chunk a list into pairs*"
msgstr "*示例：将列表分块成对*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md a18da4ad8624455d82168527106c1120
msgid "Slice"
msgstr "切片"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1656 e80fc17ebadf4489853fb6408aa0ca51
msgid "Extract a portion of a collection from `min` (inclusive) to `max` (exclusive). Supports negative indices (counted from the end). The function fails if `min >= max`, or if indices are out of bounds (after negative index resolution)."
msgstr "从集合中提取从 `min`（包含）到 `max`（不包含）的部分。支持负索引（从末尾计数）。如果 `min >= max` 或索引超出范围（在解析负索引后），函数将失败。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1660 8014935428744d12be636ef0510b1f94
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the collection to slice"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 要切片的集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1665 1ee91c9d1dd94309aecac82b66534467
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **min**: the start index (inclusive)"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **min**：起始索引（包含）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1666 bf9987b7c95545a189f2b48460e047c5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **max**: the end index (exclusive)"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **max**：结束索引（不包含）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1670 71df918e039b4415b75a4c08de2dd95f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the sliced collection"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 切片后的集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1673 26a7859e8ad047fb9dd775bd291aa0a8
msgid "*Example: get elements from index 1 to 3*"
msgstr "*示例：获取索引 1 到 3 的元素*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md 0736442d94b0458f8bcd8f4630f68ead
msgid "Sliding"
msgstr "滑动"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1688 081f99667d064dd5919ce1b1eb03a201
msgid "Create sliding windows of elements from the collection."
msgstr "从集合中创建元素的滑动窗口。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1696 09ab9b7c2f5140ee94a6b2e3b71485ad
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **size**: the number of elements in each window"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **size**：每个窗口中的元素数量。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1697 d8b187d9d8a443e6bc8eb55380187b9d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **step**: the number of elements to shift the window by"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **step**：窗口移动的元素数量。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1701 d3dcec3ad94f4355b9b3b7594c485357
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` a list of windows (list of lists)"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 窗口列表（列表的列表）。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1704 82a89487e0de41088de7f6a8553d5366
msgid "*Example: sliding window of size 2 with step 1*"
msgstr "*示例：大小为 2、步长为 1 的滑动窗口*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md ../../modules/collection.md:1718
#: 5d29f40dcb914d2dae9c76c79970dfc5 7e10dc0eddb743a0b355ab01acf8b924
msgid "Take"
msgstr "保留"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1720 259d64c75e4a4d29ac3c1d279bae1ed6
msgid "Operations that keep elements from the start of a collection."
msgstr "保留集合开头元素的操作。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1728 bd12ffd08bd6491aafaac99b5cbf618f
msgid "Take the first N elements from a collection."
msgstr "从集合中取出前 N 个元素。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1731 ../../modules/collection.md:1761
#: 0106986e4f534c9bb61feab16a09e1a1 e857c023e9de428a8d1d1627465e6b5b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the collection to take from"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 要取出的集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1736 17f2a85b0a3c4bc6bcad83672991ef1f
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`int` **number**: the number of elements to take"
msgstr "{nbt}`int` **number**：要取出的元素数量。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1740 9d90c0f82f20410e8fec3f5b139a70a5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the collection containing only the first N elements"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` 仅包含前 N 个元素的集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1743 3a28f67b52ac4cbab5440fd38356c3ee
msgid "*Example: take first 3 elements*"
msgstr "*示例：取前 3 个元素*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md da8fb52c370e41cb935b8a0618228e35
msgid "Take While"
msgstr "条件取"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1758 ff681405ddf241e581b5e64d7d59a50e
msgid "Take elements from the beginning of a collection as long as a predicate is true."
msgstr "从集合开头取元素，只要谓词为真。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1770 648ccefeb1ef4176a5ebe0a1949c1066
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` the elements taken"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` 取出的元素。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1780 9ccb1abd67c9469c883a98953ca71e6b
msgid "**Return**: success (1) to continue taking, fail (0) otherwise"
msgstr "**返回**：成功 (1) 继续取，失败 (0) 停止。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1783 b588a73e27e8481097d3053e1aeb0636
msgid "*Example: take elements until value is 4*"
msgstr "*示例：取元素直到值为 4*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md ../../modules/collection.md:1797
#: 14077301c4904010a25582cdef65f11c 34610101f84947b2921e9f9fa1805dd6
msgid "Tap"
msgstr "监听"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1799 eecaf1a81e5a47239e24c8909d4b947a
msgid "Run a lambda on the whole collection, passing it through unchanged."
msgstr "对整个集合运行 lambda，原样传递。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1807 3bbbc4e200c343aa87345cb3032bde46
msgid "Execute an operation on the entire collection. Useful for side effects or logging the collection state."
msgstr "对整个集合执行操作。适用于副作用或记录集合状态。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1815 c2f0099862454e71b98ffce48a3c77f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **run**: lambda function to execute"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **run**：要执行的 lambda 函数。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1825 d30e56b833104bcbb58490e3d1b5bdb5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`list` **value**: the entire collection"
msgstr "{nbt}`list` **value**：整个集合。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1829 bc9f5e5292e64905bb2cc31828d871da
msgid "*Example: log the size of the collection*"
msgstr "*示例：记录集合的大小*。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md ../../modules/collection.md:1843
#: 5bcbb7592ed3401d9172d20858e68fb6 ceb7397c5355479597dff5a1ee7dab58
msgid "Zip"
msgstr "配对"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1845 333513d63b99400d90ca32635a4dd94e
