msgstr "将两个集合按对应位置配对，得到一个元素对列表。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1861 03eb6888168b458b988aca6877ae305b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Storage `bs:out collection.value`**: {nbt}`list` a list of pairs `[[a1, b1], [a2, b2], ...]`, truncated to the length of the shorter collection"
msgstr "**存储 `bs:out collection.value`**：{nbt}`list` 由元素对 `[[a1, b1], [a2, b2], ...]` 组成的列表，长度与较短的集合一致。"

#: ../../modules/collection.md:1864 88112654a1bd4806b6057c000b99b018
msgid "*Example: zip two lists*"
msgstr "*示例：压缩两个列表*。"

